B.Ge=new A.eF("Fizz and foam","Self-Inflating Balloon","Fill a balloon without blowing into it.",B.z7,B.FP,B.Kc,!1,B.fN,"Balloon color",4,"Acid + Base","NaHCO\u2083 + CH\u2083COOH -> CH\u2083COONa + H\u2082O + CO\u2082","Baking soda and vinegar react and make carbon dioxide gas. The gas has nowhere to go but up the neck of the bottle, so it fills the balloon and stretches it.","Gas takes up much more room than powder and liquid, which is why a spoonful of baking soda can fill a whole balloon.","The gas inflated the balloon!",4200,!1)
