B.Gh=new A.eF("Fizz and foam","Elephant Toothpaste","A giant column of foam shoots out of the bottle.",B.z7,B.n7,B.JH,!1,B.FW,"Foam color",5,"Decomposition","2 H\u2082O\u2082 -> 2 H\u2082O + O\u2082","Peroxide slowly breaks down into water and oxygen gas. Yeast is a catalyst, so it makes this happen super fast without being used up. The oxygen gets trapped by the soap and squirts out as foam.","O\u2082 is a pair of oxygen atoms, so we need 2 H\u2082O\u2082 to get 4 oxygen atoms: 2 go into the 2 H\u2082O and 2 make the O\u2082.","Whoosh! Yeast made the peroxide release oxygen foam.",4200,!1)
