B.Gj=new A.eF("Color and change","Cabbage pH Rainbow","Turn purple cabbage juice pink, blue or green.",B.z8,B.FQ,B.IQ,!0,B.G7,null,0,"Acid-base indicator",null,"Red cabbage juice has a natural dye that changes color. Acids turn it pink or red, bases turn it blue or green, and neutral things leave it purple.","Scientists measure this with the pH scale. Low numbers are acids, 7 is neutral and high numbers are bases. The dye is an indicator: its color tells you where on the scale something is.","Color change! The cabbage juice shows acid or base.",4200,!1)
