B.Gf=new A.eF("Color and change","Rusting Nail","Watch a shiny nail turn orange over a few days.",B.z8,B.FR,B.JQ,!1,B.na,null,0,"Oxidation","4 Fe + 3 O\u2082 -> 2 Fe\u2082O\u2083","Iron slowly combines with oxygen from the air and water to make rust. Salt helps water carry tiny electric charges, so the nail rusts faster. Rust is a brand new material, not just dirt.","Rust (Fe\u2082O\u2083) has 2 iron and 3 oxygen. O\u2082 comes in pairs, so 3 O\u2082 gives 6 oxygen atoms. That fits 2 Fe\u2082O\u2083, which needs 4 iron.","Five days later: the nail is covered in orange rust.",5000,!1)
