B.Gc=new A.eF("Color and change","Penny Cleaning","Make a dull old penny shiny again.",B.YM,B.FS,B.J4,!1,B.n9,null,0,"Acid + Metal oxide","CuO + 2 CH\u2083COOH -> Cu(CH\u2083COO)\u2082 + H\u2082O","Old pennies get a dull layer of copper oxide. Vinegar is an acid and salt helps it work faster. Together they dissolve the layer, so the shiny copper underneath shows through.","Copper acetate needs 2 acetate pieces (CH\u2083COO), so we use 2 vinegar (CH\u2083COOH). The leftover hydrogen joins the oxygen from the copper oxide and leaves as water.","Sparkle! The vinegar dissolved the dull layer.",4200,!1)
