B.Gk=new A.eF("Mix and watch","Lava Lamp","Colorful blobs rise and fall in a glass.",B.YN,B.FV,B.JL,!1,B.G1,"Blob color",3,"Acid + Base","C\u2086H\u2088O\u2087 + 3 NaHCO\u2083 -> Na\u2083C\u2086H\u2085O\u2087 + 3 H\u2082O + 3 CO\u2082","Oil is lighter than water, so it floats on top and the colored water stays underneath. The fizz tablet makes carbon dioxide bubbles that grab blobs of colored water and lift them up. At the top the bubbles pop and the blobs sink back down.","The tablet is citric acid (C\u2086H\u2088O\u2087) plus baking soda. One acid reacts with 3 baking soda, so we get 3 water and 3 carbon dioxide.","The gas bubbles are carrying the blobs up and down!",6500,!1)
